    kind note;
    locator "section/872/note/8";
    text en official """Termination of Trust Territory of the Pacific Islands
For termination of Trust Territory of the Pacific Islands, see note set out preceding section 1681 of Title 48, Territories and Insular Possessions.""";
    content_hash "sha256:2bc3ffb6d8e3ca1adcf3f2bd5dde1f42bb44e4315cd89598fd50c8f633f2f12e";
